      "content": "Wait, really? I saw a blog post from a travel influencer saying it was just a common metaphor for being \"deeply moved\" or \"feeling things strongly.\" If it's that risky, I'll skip it, but I really need something that feels \"insider\" so I don't look like a tourist. Are you sure it's offensive? I don't want to overthink a simple idiom if it's actually just a way to show emotional depth.",
